      "sha256": "9c23102b6a4ef89c7e5ddeb596475b896a1f949974ceda149fd0096e7d1c555d",
      "observation": "Ghostship has0.3+0 animation,1000cast range versus2000travel,450sweep and real-hero/clone Rum eligibility. Rum defers post-mitigation damage and repays in ten nonlethal one-second health changes. Tidal Wave travels2300at700 independently from600knockback over1.25seconds, disarms without interrupting channels and is dispellable.",
      "versionContext": "Direct archived2023-02Dota2Wiki HTML HTTP200, actually read this round; compatible mechanisms, not current facets/innates."
    },
    {
      "id": "wiki2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215192140id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Silencer",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "sha256": "9cddc40233a693eae6c0b9efb030656ff726c347ce6f267f0134d703168bc6e7",
      "observation": "Glaives steals before pure damage before the physical attack; independent temporary timers, source proportional mana and victim flat mana, floor0temporary/floor1permanent, living-owner/death-category rules. Bounce is a separate50%-lineage physical spell packet with no amplification/lifesteal/onhit and leading attack-begin damage basis. Global has0.3+0.37animation and affects invisible, spell-immune and invulnerable enemies. Arcane Curse has initial damage, independent1secondDOT, silence pause/multiplier and cast penalty.",
      "versionContext": "Direct archived2023-02Dota2Wiki HTML HTTP200, actually read this round; compatible mechanisms, not current facets/innates."
    },
    {
      "id": "wiki2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215191945id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Ursa",
      "sha256": "fdc8fdbb748f2c0ecf6ab3e45356d1361a69ecbba48ab55315654c4813f73b8f",
      "observation": "Fury is conditional attack damage: add before the hit, no critical scaling, normal lifesteal and cleave, flat damage block, selective spell amplification; misses add no stack. Break refuses new stacks but preserves old stack damage. Native debuff undispellable differs from AA Strong override.",
      "versionContext": "Previously captured2023-02direct archived Wiki HTTP200, actually reread this round; AA custom values take priority."
    },
    {
      "id": "AA4",
      "url": "https://news.abilityarena.com/ability-arena-season-4/",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "observation": "Official dated update renames Gods Strength to Gabens Strength, moves AA damage to75/100/125and Super immunity to4seconds. Ghostship Super wave correction is toward the owners side.",
